00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:44.000
I just have to keep sort of clicking through and everything is automatically filled in for me. And so to the extent that we can reintroduce frictions into our spending, this is something that's helpful. And so making rules for yourself could be, I'm only going to buy in person would be one kind of rule. That comes with other challenges, which is like now you're at the store and now you're tempted by all the different things in the store. So sort of going with a more concrete plan in that case. But I think just removing your credit card online, you know, taking it down from Google Pay. and Apple pay. These kinds of things will just lead us to pause and reflect and we can still buy all of the things that we want to buy, but really making sure that we've thought through these

