decisions, I think is going to be one valuable component. And then the other is to try to be thoughtful about when we're spending. So setting aside specific times to be making purchases as opposed to either being online and sort of shopping out of, you know, different sorts of emotions or boredom or going to the supermarket even and you can go to the supermarket when you're starving or you can go to the supermarket when you've come with a plan. And if you go when you're starving, like probably you leave with a lot of Kit Katz and not necessarily the food that you needed.

