that they're not aware of, that are automatically renewing. it's incredibly difficult. I mean, I don't know incredibly difficult, but oftentimes, right, signing up for something is very easy and you frequently will click a button that says auto renew or you won't be allowed to sign up unless you agree to auto renewal. So I actually think the topic of apps is sort of, it depends on what the app is and how helpful it could be. Like surely there are apps out there that can be helpful for managing your finances.

