but instead it's almost a discomfort with credit of, right, I want to, I want to be more focused on the fact that I have this money and savings that's available. That can be the driver. Again, treating these two pools is like really distinct. Right, right. So just to wrap up, what are the big questions that you are still trying to answer? What are you working on right now? So great question.

